        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B;" value="&lt;b&gt;KEY DESIGN NOTES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key | FK = foreign key | UQ = unique | ? = nullable FK&lt;br&gt;• CUSTOMER accounts: customer_id NOT NULL, account_type NOT NULL, available_balance NOT NULL.&lt;br&gt;• SETTLEMENT/SUSPENSE accounts: customer_id NULL, account_type NULL, available_balance NULL.&lt;br&gt;• LEDGER_ENTRIES are immutable: INSERT only for the application role.&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE(reversal_of_transaction_id) prevents double-reversal at DB level.&lt;br&gt;• available_balance is a cached projection; source of truth is LEDGER_ENTRIES.&lt;br&gt;• All amounts are NUMERIC(19,2) — never FLOAT/REAL.&lt;br&gt;• All timestamps are TIMESTAMPTZ stored in UTC." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="1460" x="40" y="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0ttXP2YF6YNahCv21fYx-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B;" value="&lt;b&gt;MODELLING NOTES &amp;amp; CONSTRAINTS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; UQ = unique.&lt;br&gt;CUSTOMER accounts have an owner; SETTLEMENT/SUSPENSE accounts may not. Deposits/withdrawals balance through system ledger accounts.&lt;br&gt;Posted transactions require balanced ledger entries. Reversals add compensating records; never erase history.&lt;br&gt;Reconcile cached balances against the ledger. All records in this academic model use synthetic data." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="460" x="1340" y="1200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
